From 46861ccecdfd155627fcd144fe01ca6ece565809 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 07:38:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gui): REAPER banner logo + red retheme (banner, accents,
 nav buttons)

- state.js: replace top-left banner with images/REAPER.png; hide redundant
  modelName_top (kept in DOM for dispatchEvent) and drop the baked-in Merlin logo
- index_style.css: body #21333e->#0d0d0d; .banner1 -> solid black #0b0b0b;
  left-nav hover + selected (.menu_clicked/.menuClicked) blue -> red
- form_style.css: button hover, active/hover sub-tabs blue -> red
- add www/images/REAPER.png (1529x161)

Sprite-free: all nav accents are CSS, recolored directly. Top-menu icons left as-is.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/www/form_style.css    |  16 ++++-----
 release/src/router/www/images/REAPER.png | Bin 0 -> 307146 bytes
 release/src/router/www/index_style.css   |  40 +++++++++++------------
 release/src/router/www/state.js          |   6 ++--
 4 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 release/src/router/www/images/REAPER.png

diff --git a/release/src/router/www/form_style.css b/release/src/router/www/form_style.css
index f623bd63c8..77e5583c40 100644
--- a/release/src/router/www/form_style.css
+++ b/release/src/router/www/form_style.css
@@ -507,10 +507,10 @@ html::-webkit-scrollbar-track{
 	word-break: break-all;
 }
 .button_gen:hover{
-	background: #085F96;
-	background: -webkit-linear-gradient(#09639C 0%, #003047 100%);
-	background: -o-linear-gradient(#09639C 0%, #003047 100%);
-	background: linear-gradient(#09639C 0%, #003047 100%);
+	background: #B81414;
+	background: -webkit-linear-gradient(#D11919 0%, #5A0606 100%);
+	background: -o-linear-gradient(#D11919 0%, #5A0606 100%);
+	background: linear-gradient(#D11919 0%, #5A0606 100%);
  	hlbr:expression(this.onFocus=this.blur()); /* for IE */
 }
 .button_gen_dis{
@@ -1027,10 +1027,10 @@ color:#FFFFFF;
 	border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
 }
 .tab_NW:hover{
-	background: #4F5B5F;
+	background: #7A1212;
 }
 .tab_NW:hover span{
-	background: #4F5B5F;
+	background: #7A1212;
 }
 
 .tabclick_NW {
@@ -1045,7 +1045,7 @@ color:#FFFFFF;
     text-align:center;
     text-decoration: none;
 	max-width:240px;
-	background: #4F5B5F;
+	background: #B81414;
 	border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
 }
 .tabclick_NW span {
@@ -1058,7 +1058,7 @@ color:#FFFFFF;
     padding: 5px 5px 0 12px;
     line-height: 20px;
 	font-size: 13px;
-	background: #4F5B5F;
+	background: #B81414;
 	border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
 }
 
